    rdfs:label "01CoverDefinitionConcreteAnchorExample" ;
    silm:hasExample "In '01CoverDefinitionConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the rendered image of the Mittens olog diagram (head, torso, paws, tail, body-mass 4.2 kg tag, vet-record stamp, Cat-classification arrow) input to the topology-JEPA pipeline; also, the rectangular pixel window covering the head region of Mittens-the-cat in the diagram, including the cat-classification node and its outgoing Cat arrow; also, the rectangular pixel window covering the torso of Mittens including the BodyMass 4.2 kg quality node and its measurement arrow." .

