    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "01CoverDefinitionYonedaHomLegExample" ;
    silm:hasExample "In '01CoverDefinitionYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'The Visual Patch Cover' the typed_patch_inclusion arrow witnesses the head patch U_head is included into the Mittens diagram image I_Mittens as a typed sub-region preserving the cat-classification node; this typed leg is load-bearing for the patch cover step of the topology-JEPA pipeline.; also, In 'The Visual Patch Cover' the cocone_leg_head arrow witnesses the head local hypothesis emits its cocone leg into the assembled Mittens graph, contributing the cat-classification subgraph; this typed leg is load-bearing for the patch cover step of the topology-JEPA pipeline." .

