    rdfs:label "04ColimitYonedaHomLegExample" ;
    silm:hasExample "In '04ColimitYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'The Colimit and its Tightness' the universal_mediator arrow witnesses the unique mediating morphism from the Mittens colimit to the VetCarePlan_77 cocone, witnessing universality of the colimit assembly; this typed leg is load-bearing for the colimit step of the topology-JEPA pipeline.; also, In 'The Colimit and its Tightness' the vet_evidence_attachment arrow witnesses the vet record evidence morphism attaches the signature of Dr. Osei to the body-mass quality node within the body local hypothesis; this typed leg is load-bearing for the colimit step of the topology-JEPA pipeline." .

